OL,3,GNEWSA'Devoted mother' died from heat
OL,4,Astroke climbing Wales' highest mountain
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother who was celebrating her
OL,7,Fbirthday by climbing Wales' highest
OL,8,Fmountain developed heat stroke and
OL,9,Fdied, an inquest has found.
OL,11,FSophie Goodyer-Bird, from Birmingham,
OL,12,Ftravelled to Eryri National Park -
OL,13,FSnowdonia - in July, a few days after
OL,14,Fher 35th birthday.
OL,16,FThe hearing in Caernarfon was told the
OL,17,Fmother-of-one found the climb more
OL,18,Fchallenging than she had expected, but
OL,19,Fmanaged to reach the summit of Yr
OL,20,FWyddfa - also known as Snowdon - with a
OL,21,Ffriend.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
